WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.969 --> 00:00:06.899
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie, welcome back
to my season 4 countdown.

00:00:06.899 --> 00:00:11.170
I wanted to talk about the Marathon HBO is
doing starting this Friday and provide some

00:00:11.170 --> 00:00:15.230
extra alternatives in case you don’t get
HBO and you don’t want to ask your friends

00:00:15.230 --> 00:00:17.689
for their HBO Go Password.

00:00:17.689 --> 00:00:20.279
If they’re willing to give it to you they
deserve a high five.

00:00:20.279 --> 00:00:25.929
For the rest of us there’s still a ton of
stuff to do like brushing up on the chapters

00:00:25.929 --> 00:00:37.330
that the first couple of episodes will cover
and checking out that new Arya Winds of Winter

00:00:37.330 --> 00:00:41.760
chapter george rr martin posted.

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:45.300
If you’re finding me for the first time
and are all like WTF Game of Thrones Countdown.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:51.580
I’m just doing a couple extra videos to
get back into dragon mode.

00:00:51.580 --> 00:00:53.220
Before episode 1 airs this sunday.

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:54.790
Be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:00:54.790 --> 00:00:59.610
More details about everything at the end of
the video and in the description.

00:00:59.610 --> 00:01:00.690
(point down).

00:01:00.690 --> 00:01:02.630
First let’s talk Marathon.

00:01:02.630 --> 00:01:07.150
If you have access to HBO they’ll be doing
a 60 hour marathon starting on Friday.

00:01:07.150 --> 00:01:11.460
They’re just airing everything from season
1 to season 3 back to back, twice.

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:15.960
With the last episode ending just before Season
4 episode 1 airs.

00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:20.240
So you could potentially lock yourself in
a room and do nothing but watch it all weekend.

00:01:20.240 --> 00:01:23.310
I would not advise doing that, but high fives
if you want to try.

00:01:23.310 --> 00:01:27.170
For people who don’t have access to HBO
or if you don’t feel like re-watching everything

00:01:27.170 --> 00:01:29.250
again there’s the books and expanded material.

00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:30.250
Even though they’ve blended a lot of elements
from books 3 and 4 together already, here’s

00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:31.250
which chapters to read or re-read before episode
1 on Sunday.

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:33.310
For Dany, you should start with Storm of Swords
chapter 42.

00:01:33.310 --> 00:01:38.340
That ends right where season 3 ended.

00:01:38.340 --> 00:01:42.170
If you want a preview of what Mereen is going
to be like you can skip ahead and read her

00:01:42.170 --> 00:01:43.890
next POV chapter which is 57.

00:01:43.890 --> 00:01:50.619
Thankfully most of her story the first part
of the season is still contained to book 3.

00:01:50.619 --> 00:01:54.670
For Kings Landing Peoples it’s a little
trickier because Jaimie came back sooner than

00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:56.119
he did in the books.

00:01:56.119 --> 00:02:00.780
With the exception of him, almost everything
you need to re-read is also in book 3.

00:02:00.780 --> 00:02:03.630
I would use Tyrion’s chapters as a guide.

00:02:03.630 --> 00:02:08.509
Starting with chapter 53, if you want to re-read
the Red Wedding chapter and what follows go

00:02:08.509 --> 00:02:10.970
all the way back to chapter 49.

00:02:10.970 --> 00:02:12.390
Lots of reading I know.

00:02:12.390 --> 00:02:19.030
So basically if you don’t want any spoilers
just stick to what’s between chapters 42

00:02:19.030 --> 00:02:20.030
and 53.

00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:23.970
Don’t read past that because there’s a
Jon Snow chapter with some spoilery stuff.

00:02:23.970 --> 00:02:28.750
If you don’t feel like reading the books
then I’d recommend buying the card game

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:32.270
or one of the awesome 3D puzzles.

00:02:32.270 --> 00:02:37.380
I’m actually going to Geek and Sundry’s
Tabletop Day on saturday, so I’m hoping

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:39.660
to find some people playing the card game
there.

00:02:39.660 --> 00:02:42.670
If you live in los angeles I think there’s
still tickets available.

00:02:42.670 --> 00:02:44.640
They include hot dogs and beer.

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:47.819
You have to be over 13 to get in though.

00:02:47.819 --> 00:02:48.819
Because booze.

00:02:48.819 --> 00:02:50.569
Obviously 21 to partake.

00:02:50.569 --> 00:02:51.870
But there will be tons of games.

00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:56.069
Here’s all my social links, I’ll be posting
pictures and videos to instagram and twitter

00:02:56.069 --> 00:02:58.400
throughout the day.

00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:03.340
I’ll also post the tickets link for that
in the comments below.

00:03:03.340 --> 00:03:06.040
In related news I’ll probably have time
for about two more bonus Game of Thrones videos

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:10.440
before Sunday, so let me know what you want
to see in those.

00:03:10.440 --> 00:03:18.670
When it does come back I’ll be doing Sunday
reviews and monday Q&amp;A’s just like for Walking

00:03:18.670 --> 00:03:19.670
Dead.

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:23.000
Since a lot of international people said they
don’t get to watch episodes till the next

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:30.920
day after people in the US I might do two
giveaways or split it up somehow with a Tuesday

00:03:30.920 --> 00:03:31.920
Video.

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:36.019
Let me know when Game of Thrones airs in your
country so I can figure it out.

00:03:36.019 --> 00:03:40.620
Right now click here for the rest of my countdown
videos and click here for the last trailer.

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:43.000
Thanks for watching, see you guys tonight.

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:43.640
High Fives!

